    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d729">

                <pb facs="0759" n="501" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg501"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2015</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Gerard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-07T13:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 7, 1915, 1 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 8, 1.30 p.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2700. Informed from fairly reliable source Chancellor had about eleven submarine
                    commanders at dinner and begged them to be careful, much to rage of Von Tirpitz.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gerard</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
